      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Werribee**, there are several locksmiths that install and configure digital and keyless locks, including brands like Yale, Eufy, Samsung, Lockly, and Aqara.\n\nSome well-reviewed options include:\n\n- Citywest Locksmiths – Werribee-based, 24/7 service, installs digital and smart locks, and can also advise on the right lock for your door. Their website specifically mentions keyless and digital lock installation. [citywestlocksmiths.com.au](https://citywestlocksmiths.com.au/digital-lock-installation-keyless-entry-keyless-locks/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Sentry Locksmiths – Highly rated local locksmith offering residential and commercial lock services.\n- Unique Locksmith – Mobile locksmith servicing Melbourne's west with strong customer reviews.\n- WILLI LOCKSMITH LANDING – Serves the Werribee/Williams Landing area and offers extended daily hours.\n\nTypical installation costs in the Werribee/Melbourne area are:\n- **Straight replacement** (existing deadbolt): around **A$150–A$250** for labour.\n- **New smart lock requiring drilling or door modifications:** around **A$250–A$450+**, depending on the door and lock model. [www.airtasker.com](https://www.airtasker.com/au/services/lock-installation/werribee-vic/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you already have a smart lock, the installer will usually:\n- Remove the existing lock.\n- Fit and align the new smart lock.\n- Configure the keypad/app.\n- Test locking, unlocking, and emergency access.\n- Show you how to use the system.\n\nIf you haven't purchased a lock yet, tell me:\n- **Your door type** (timber, aluminium, security screen, etc.).\n- **The smart lock brand/model** you're considering (or your budget).\n\nI can recommend compatible locks and estimate the total installed cost.",
